            <RURComments xml:space="preserve">
                <mainWalls>I added R-20 to your main walls as we discussed. There are many ways to add insulation but the numbers here reflect the effective R-value of the walls which takes into account other materials i.e framing.</mainWalls>
                <ceilings>As discussed, I doubled the amount of insulation in the attic to R-40. Before adding more insulation you might want to consider sealing any penetrations into the attic to reduce air leakage. Warm moist air rises and tries to leave through those holes resulting in heat loss and potential condensation problems.</ceilings>
            </RURComments>
